Wine fixes for the cool_fox-main build (Proton, vkd3d-proton, NVIDIA):
the indirect clamp and the ambient stand-in are compiled at run time with
Wine's d3dcompiler, which has no ByteAddressBuffer methods, no interlocked
methods on resources and drops [RootSignature]. The clamp is rewritten to
structured buffers and one walking group, root signatures are made in
host::compute_root, and isnan/isinf are replaced. Also the two fixes the
linux run.sh applies to fxceless's fork (empty pipeline library blob,
Wine's ws2_32 has no WSAConnectByList/GetAddrInfoExA).

Apply with:  patch -p1 -d cool_fox-main < cool-fox-wine.patch

